\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Balanced detection. The 50:50 coupler delivers the sum and difference of the backscatter and LO fields to two matched photodiodes; the output is the difference of their photocurrents, in which the common-mode terms cancel and only the beat term $2\sqrt  {P_{LO} P_{RS}}\cos (2\pi \Delta f t)$ remains.}}{16}{figure.2.1}\protected@file@percent }
